 <h3><u>Tu padhta jaa qur\'aan</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Mere majaye teri zainab ki chadar tujhpar qurbaan<br> tu padhta jaa qur'aan..(2)</p> 
  <p>Har simt tamashayi hai khade, meri aankhein hai hairaan<br> tu padhta jaa qur'aan..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Himmat de, sabr de, taqat de<br> allah mere bhai tujhko<br> tu sura e kahf jo padhta hai<br> sunte hai tamashayi tujhko<br> bat jaata hai kuch pal ke liye, kufe walo ka dhyaan<br> tu padhta jaa qur'aan..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Hai dil mein mere bus ek chubhan<br> mai kaun hu koi jaan na le<br> baalo'n se chipaye hu chehra<br> kahin koi mujhe pehchaan na le<br> lekin ye hai zehra ka kunba, koi karta hai ailaan<br> tu padhta jaa qur'aan..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Kis haal mein hai teri maa jayi<br> zara dekh to le mujhe naize se<br> meri pusht hai durro se chalni<br> mere shano par hai neel pade<br> kal tak mai jahan shehzaadi thi, wahi aaj hai meri ye shaan<br> tu padhta jaa qur'aan..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Hame zalim patthar marte hai<br> sadqo ki khajure phaik te hai<br> azaad kiya tha humne jinhe<br> wahi aaj tamasha dekhte hai<br> jis simt nigaah uthati hu, meri maut ke hai samaan<br> tu padhta jaa qur'aan..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Hum apne shikasta kaandho par<br> sou(100) karbobalaye leke chale<br> ye zulm bhi koi kam to nahi<br> ek rassi hai aur 12 gale<br> meri khatir rabb se maang dua, mujhe jaana hai zindaan<br> tu padhta jaa qur'aan..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. Ghaazi ka alam mere saath me hai<br> akbar ki azaa'n mere saath me hai<br> hai shaam e ghareeba aankho me<br> khaimo ka dhua mere saath me hai<br> pardes mein humko ummat ne, kya khoob rakha mehmaan<br> tu padhta jaa qur'aan..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Mere phool mere nauras gunche<br> hai aaj sina ki shakho'n par<br> wo qasim o akbar ke sar hai<br> wo aun o mohammad wo asghar<br> taqdeer ne khoob sajaye hai, naizo pe mere armaan<br> tu padhta jaa qur'aan..(2)</p> 
  <p>8. Awaaz ka parda reh jaye<br> bolungi ali ke lehje mein<br> sab dekhle baate karti hai<br> zainab bhi wali ke lehje mein<br> miljayega teri tilawat se, mere khutbo ko unwaan<br> tu padhta jaa qur'aan..(2)</p> 
  <p>9. Sajjad ke dil se puche koi<br> hai kaisi qayamat ki ye ghadi<br> hatho me hai jiske hathkadiya<br> payro mein hai dohri bedi padi<br> beemar ne langar pehna hai, insaaf kare insaan</p> 
  <p>10. Aye nayyar o amir aati hai<br> reh reh ke azakhano se sadaa<br> zainab ki tamanna hai matam<br> aur aasu hai zehra ki dua<br> paigham tera pohchayenge, ghar ghar tere nauhakhwan<br> tu padhta jaa qur'aan..(4)</p> 
